{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.unusedHavesSuffices\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">unusedHavesSuffices</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.unusedHavesSuffices`.\n\n---\n\nA linter for checking that declarations don't have unused term mode have statements.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.unusedHavesSuffices","kind":"def","line":270,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.unusedHavesSuffices","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L270-L271"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.unusedArguments\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">unusedArguments</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.unusedArguments`.\n\n---\n\nA linter for checking for unused arguments. We skip all declarations that contain `sorry` in\ntheir value, and allow arguments starting with `_` to be unused.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.unusedArguments","kind":"def","line":268,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.unusedArguments","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L268-L269"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.synTaut\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">synTaut</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.synTaut`.\n\n---\n\nA linter for checking that declarations aren't syntactic tautologies.\nChecks whether a lemma is a declaration of the form `∀ a b ... z, e₁ = e₂`\nwhere `e₁` and `e₂` are identical exprs.\nWe call declarations of this form syntactic tautologies.\nSuch lemmas are (mostly) useless and sometimes introduced unintentionally when proving basic facts\nwith rfl when elaboration results in a different term than the user intended.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.synTaut","kind":"def","line":266,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.synTaut","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L266-L267"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.findUnusedHaves\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">findUnusedHaves</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Lean.Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">Lean.MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a>)</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.findUnusedHaves`.\n\n---\n\nReturn a list of unused `let_fun` terms in an expression that introduce proofs.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.findUnusedHaves","kind":"def","line":264,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.findUnusedHaves","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L264-L265"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.explicitVarsOfIff\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">explicitVarsOfIff</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.explicitVarsOfIff`.\n\n---\n\nA linter for checking if variables appearing on both sides of an iff are explicit. Ideally, such\nvariables should be implicit instead.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.explicitVarsOfIff","kind":"def","line":262,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.explicitVarsOfIff","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L262-L263"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.docBlameThm\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">docBlameThm</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.docBlameThm`.\n\n---\n\nA linter for checking theorem doc strings.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.docBlameThm","kind":"def","line":260,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.docBlameThm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L260-L261"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.docBlame\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">docBlame</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.docBlame`.\n\n---\n\nA linter for checking definition doc strings.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.docBlame","kind":"def","line":258,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.docBlame","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L258-L259"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.checkType\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkType</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Batteries.Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"**Alias** of `Batteries.Linter.checkType`.\n\n---\n\nA linter for checking whether statements of declarations are well-typed, with the\nelaborator's type checker `Meta.check` (at `.all` transparency) rather than the kernel.\n\nThis linter is disabled by default. The kernel has normally accepted every statement already, so\nthe linter mostly reports statements that the elaborator's checker rejects although the kernel\naccepted them, or that were added with kernel checking disabled. It has flagged statements in the\npast, for example lemmas generated by `simps`, but rarely, and it is expensive: about a third of\nMathlib's linter heartbeats. To replay the kernel's checks of a library, use `leanchecker`; for a\ncheck by an independent kernel, use `lean4lean` (https://github.com/digama0/lean4lean).","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.checkType","kind":"def","line":256,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.checkType","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L256-L257"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.explicitVarsOfIff\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">explicitVarsOfIff</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A linter for checking if variables appearing on both sides of an iff are explicit. Ideally, such\nvariables should be implicit instead.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.explicitVarsOfIff","kind":"def","line":227,"name":"Batteries.Linter.explicitVarsOfIff","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L227-L248"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.unusedHavesSuffices\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">unusedHavesSuffices</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A linter for checking that declarations don't have unused term mode have statements.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.unusedHavesSuffices","kind":"def","line":203,"name":"Batteries.Linter.unusedHavesSuffices","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L203-L225"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.findUnusedHaves\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">findUnusedHaves</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Lean.Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">Lean.MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a>)</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Return a list of unused `let_fun` terms in an expression that introduce proofs.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.findUnusedHaves","kind":"def","line":180,"name":"Batteries.Linter.findUnusedHaves","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L180-L188"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.synTaut\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">synTaut</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A linter for checking that declarations aren't syntactic tautologies.\nChecks whether a lemma is a declaration of the form `∀ a b ... z, e₁ = e₂`\nwhere `e₁` and `e₂` are identical exprs.\nWe call declarations of this form syntactic tautologies.\nSuch lemmas are (mostly) useless and sometimes introduced unintentionally when proving basic facts\nwith rfl when elaboration results in a different term than the user intended.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.synTaut","kind":"def","line":153,"name":"Batteries.Linter.synTaut","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L153-L178"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.checkType\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkType</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A linter for checking whether statements of declarations are well-typed, with the\nelaborator's type checker `Meta.check` (at `.all` transparency) rather than the kernel.\n\nThis linter is disabled by default. The kernel has normally accepted every statement already, so\nthe linter mostly reports statements that the elaborator's checker rejects although the kernel\naccepted them, or that were added with kernel checking disabled. It has flagged statements in the\npast, for example lemmas generated by `simps`, but rarely, and it is expensive: about a third of\nMathlib's linter heartbeats. To replay the kernel's checks of a library, use `leanchecker`; for a\ncheck by an independent kernel, use `lean4lean` (https://github.com/digama0/lean4lean).","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.checkType","kind":"def","line":132,"name":"Batteries.Linter.checkType","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L132-L151"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.docBlameThm\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">docBlameThm</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A linter for checking theorem doc strings.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.docBlameThm","kind":"def","line":111,"name":"Batteries.Linter.docBlameThm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L111-L130"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.docBlame\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">docBlame</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A linter for checking definition doc strings.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.docBlame","kind":"def","line":83,"name":"Batteries.Linter.docBlame","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L83-L109"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.unusedArguments\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">unusedArguments</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Linter/Basic.html#Batteries.Linter\">Linter</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A linter for checking for unused arguments. We skip all declarations that contain `sorry` in\ntheir value, and allow arguments starting with `_` to be unused.","docLink":"./Batteries/Linter/Misc.html#Batteries.Linter.unusedArguments","kind":"def","line":28,"name":"Batteries.Linter.unusedArguments","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/dd0900df51045e7d9be143ed167c9d200bcf2b45/Batteries/Linter/Misc.lean#L28-L81"}}],"imports":["Batteries.Linter.Basic","Batteries.Tactic.Alias","Init","Lean.DocString","Lean.Linter.Deprecated","Lean.Meta.Check","Lean.Meta.Instances","Lean.Util.CollectFVars"],"instances":[],"name":"Batteries.Linter.Misc"}